          "start": 3033,
          "old": "",
          "new": "Membership in the twisted lattice means that the two coordinates have a common lift. -/\ntheorem mem_lattice_iff (p : X \u00d7 Twist \u03c4 Y) :\n    p \u2208 lattice f g \u03c4 \u03b1 hdiv hinc \u2194 \u2203 n : N, f n=p.1 \u2227 g n=p.2.val := by rfl\n\n/-- "
